# Crossroads_13 (the Barger, the Buzzers and three Goams): in at the left gate, a pit to jump, then a stair
# of drops and hops down and to the right, out of the right-hand gate. The Goams are waited out one at a
# time (HK_WALK_GOAM_LEFT and _RIGHT: ticks left in the nearest one's Down window). Hop recipes from the journey-crossroads
# replay.
at 0.5 12.4
guard 3
walk 8.3
leap 8.3 right 60 16.4 12.39 cross 24                # over the pit
guard 3
drop 25.3 9.39                                       # off the ledge, onto the step below
leap 25.26 right 60 33.55 6.39 cross 24              # over the first Goam
guard 3
walk 35.9                                            # the ledge before the second Goam
wait until HK_WALK_GOAM_RIGHT ge 45 timeout 900
drop 38.75 4.39
wait until HK_WALK_GOAM_RIGHT ge 50 timeout 900      # a wall stops him here; the third Goam's window opens
leap 38.75 right 46 44.75 4.39 cross 24              # over it
guard 3
leap 44.75 right 20 46.55 6.39 cross 24
guard 3
leap 48.35 right 60 56.65 6.39 cross 24
guard 3
leap 56.75 right 33 61.31 9.39 cross 24
leap 61.31 right 48 68.0 12.39 cross 24
guard 3
walk 70.75
leap 70.75 right 40 78.36 13.39 cross 24
guard 3
hold right until HK_SCENE_LOADS ge 8 timeout 1200    # out of the right-hand gate
wait until HK_GAME_MODE == 1 timeout 1800
